    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.poster.avif?t=1748578913\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.webm?t=1748578913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.mp4?t=1748578913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been imprisoned in the NONOLITH; an impossible structure filled with secrets. Copy and paste blocks to build stairs, bridges and more. As you explore, you will discover incredible tricks that redefine what is and has always been possible.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE NONOLITH.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and learn the secret laws of this impossible place. The walls will part for those who know the many truths.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY THE NONOLITH.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the most adventurous, escape is only the beginning. Achieve mastery and the NONOLITH will succumb to your will.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.poster.avif?t=1748578913\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.webm?t=1748578913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.mp4?t=1748578913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been imprisoned in the NONOLITH; an impossible structure filled with secrets. Copy and paste blocks to build stairs, bridges and more. As you explore, you will discover incredible tricks that redefine what is and has always been possible.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE NONOLITH.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and learn the secret laws of this impossible place. The walls will part for those who know the many truths.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY THE NONOLITH.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the most adventurous, escape is only the beginning. Achieve mastery and the NONOLITH will succumb to your will.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Discover the countless secrets of the NONOLITH. Copy and paste blocks to reach new areas, and master hidden mechanics that let you do the seemingly impossible. You are very powerful, you just don't know it yet.",
